{"title":"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 48","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Diameter <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" /> of a circle with center <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51da37d984564162c87710ca27bea422f657fb73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> units. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, and on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/0/840e2b592390eb6ec918fa6f3292716ce170de66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"18\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is any point on the circle. Then the broken-line path from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/0/010e78566243f1ccfdd9a098b264fc58ca1cc3f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{has the same length for all positions of }{P}\\qquad\\\\  \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{exceeds }{10}\\text{ units for all positions of }{P}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{cannot exceed }{10}\\text{ units}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{is shortest when }{\\triangle CPD}\\text{ is a right triangle}\\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{is longest when }{P}\\text{ is equidistant from }{C}\\text{ and }{D}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"382\" height=\"96\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, then the length is 10, eliminating answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/313048c3149436615f6cd06b7f1bec83420d6a37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(B)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is equidistant from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, the length is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/4/2945609370db8576272da3964a9bb2377460fe84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\sqrt{1^2+5^2}=2\\sqrt{26}&gt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"190\" height=\"21\" />, eliminating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/565ab5e3715db52b9176b04dd9991b71f4e93a86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(A)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/d/abd337e8b85dc471b3cb7c333dea9fd5d610a2f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(C)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>If triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/5/475c1750cd40aa671c95911512ff47f24201c3eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CDP$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is right, then angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/5/475c1750cd40aa671c95911512ff47f24201c3eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CDP$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is right or angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/b/f5bfd38b5661a86d4be8b70650975add7a5d4036.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DCP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is right. Assume that angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/b/f5bfd38b5661a86d4be8b70650975add7a5d4036.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DCP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is right. Triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/b/92b38136cabb69ee2f7b5711190e0042354f3419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$APB$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> is right, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd8a2ea52b56cb2f8e05b5361fc30c0acc2537d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CP=\\sqrt{4*6}=\\sqrt{24}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"163\" height=\"21\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/5/35514a90e73a907aec31fdc1072abf6bbecee324.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DP=\\sqrt{28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"89\" height=\"21\" />, so the length we are looking for is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d08493326a9215d7f9a081682afb6ae938720c23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{24}+\\sqrt{28}&gt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" />, eliminating <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/4/7b4066cd24c53cd4053f840d210f974f46e1d913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(D)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/a/02ad991c2821130f0d7e456d453252c19a320752.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(E)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/a/9da7272b06f09b1f8f6b67d6d1b31a3261a4aabd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" />\n</p><p>Note: Say you are not convinced that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d08493326a9215d7f9a081682afb6ae938720c23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{24}+\\sqrt{28}&gt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" />. We can prove this as follows.\n</p><p>Start by simplifying the equation: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/5/595d328521c5998b081b4f22bb5318f436fdc767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{7}&gt;5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Square both sides: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/0/4a0624dcf881e6710aa1964bd11f5ae17fb1a00c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6+2\\sqrt{42}+7&gt;25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"149\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Simplify: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/d/c5d825480950bf21ff2e99e60ff26806be095554.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{42}&gt;6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"68\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Square both sides again: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/f/46fa4bcc0836fcfe2e31a3eca7d37460e38a41c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$42&gt;36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />. From here, we can just reverse our steps to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d08493326a9215d7f9a081682afb6ae938720c23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{24}+\\sqrt{28}&gt;10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_48&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME\" title=\"1958 AHSME\">1958 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1958 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1958\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">Problem 47</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 49\">Problem 49</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title