/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_41\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 41\">41</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_42\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 42\">42</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_43\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 43\">43</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_44\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 44\">44</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_45\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 45\">45</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_46\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 46\">46</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_47\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 47\">47</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">48</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_49\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 49\">49</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1958_AHSME_Problems/Problem_50\" title=\"1958 AHSME Problems/Problem 50\">50</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016215555\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.050 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.115 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 355/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3464/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 236/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7759/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   16.898      1 -total\n 69.66%   11.772      1 Template:AHSME_50p_box\n 29.06%    4.911      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13231:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016215555 and revision id 209307. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}